## 2. DTO INTERFACE PARITY — CLEAN
All 28 napi `#[napi(object)]` structs in crates/ql-bindings-node/src/lib.rs have a matching IDE TS
interface. Engine DTO list (from `napi(object)` grep): ArityJson, BatchOptionsJson, BatchResultJson,
CellAddrJson, CellRangeJson, CellSnapshotJson, CellValueJson, ChangedCellJson, DiagnosticJson,
EventJson, EventPageJson, FormatDefJson, FormatIdJson, FunctionMetadataJson, OperationStateJson,
PresenceStateJson, PythonWorkerConfigJson, RangeColumnJson, RangeQueryOptionsJson, RangeResultJson,
RemovedCellJson, SessionOpJson, SheetInfoJson, SheetSnapshotJson, TableSpecJson, UndoRedoResultJson,
WorkbookSnapshotDeltaJson, WorkbookSnapshotJson — each has an `export interface` in types.ts
(verified by name-set intersection).

Field-level spot checks (engine struct ↔ TS interface):
- `WorkbookSnapshotJson`: sheets[], formats[], dateSystem, version?(Buffer), schemaVersion?(M5) —
  match. schemaVersion present on BOTH snapshot AND delta DTOs (engine stamps `ql_session::SCHEMA_VERSION`
  = 1; empty_delta() at lib.rs:385 + snapshot path).
- `WorkbookSnapshotDeltaJson`: changedCells, removedCells, sheetsChanged, sheetsRemoved,
  formatsAdded, version(Buffer), fullRebuildRequired, fullRebuildReason?, schemaVersion? — match.
  `fullRebuildReason` is the 4-member union 'no_prior_version'|'cache_cleared'|'stale_horizon'|
  'epoch_mismatch', mirroring `full_rebuild_reason_str` (lib.rs:392-399) exactly.
- `CellValueJson`: kind union includes 'blank' on BOTH sides (engine emits kind:'blank' for
  CellValue::Blank via the session converter; IDE added it at 6.3-1c, types.ts:80). Payloads
  number?/boolean?/text?/error? — napi Option::None → absent (undefined, not null); TS uses `?:`.
- `FormatIdJson`: kind 'builtin'|'custom'; engine `builtin`/`customCounter` are `Option<f64>`
  (6.3-2 hardening H1, lib.rs:683/690) and the TS mirror types them `number?` — semantically a
  faithful narrowing (the wire value is a whole u32; f64 is the no-coercion transport).
  `customPeer` BigInt↔bigint — match.
- Buffer↔Uint8Array / Buffer: snapshot `version` + delta `version` are napi `Buffer` ↔ TS `Buffer`;
  `exportBytes`/`mergeBytes`/`export` use `Uint8Array` ↔ `Uint8Array`. Consistent.
- BigInt↔bigint: peerId, customPeer, TransactionId, OperationId, poll cursor — all bigint on both.
No field present on a napi DTO but missing/mistyped on the IDE mirror was found.

