## 5. SILENT-INCOMPATIBILITY SWEEP — none found
No code, DTO field, or method on the frozen engine contract is unrepresented on the IDE side. The
compile-enforced Record shape + the loader presence blocks + the schemaVersion assert form three
independent guards, and all three are in sync with the engine at this HEAD.

